<title>SWITZERLAND: Basle July inflation at 0.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Basle July inflation at 0.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices in Basle, Switzerland's second-biggest city, fell 0.1 percent in July from the month before for an unchanged year-on-year inflation rate of 0.5 percent, the city statistics office said.</p>
<p>				   July 1997     June 1997     July 1996</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change   -0.1 pct	+0.1 pct	-0.1 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		+0.5 pct	+0.5 pct	+0.9 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)	  104.1	   104.2	   103.6</p>
<p>NOTE - The office said year-on-year inflation had been at 0.5 percent for three months &quot;and should decline somewhat towards year-end&quot;. It did not elaborate.-Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
